			shape: "netheritetier"
			size: 1.5d
			subtitle: "Devourer of Despair"
			tasks: [{
				entity: "macabre:gargamaw"
				icon: "macabre:gargamaw_heart"
				id: "1DD8960D5FE759B6"
				title: "Slay &cGargamaw, the Grotesque Consumer"
				type: "kill"
				value: 1L
			}]
			x: 9.72142857142854d
			y: -1.3214285714285694d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4C22709BA6360D9B"]
			description: ["&4To face Morphegor is to confront your own fractured soul. This prophet of division splits reality itself, showing you truths you were never meant to see. In his presence, you become two—the observer and the observed, locked in eternal paradox. From his defeat, his heart will spill forth, still beating with divided purpose."]
			icon_scale: 1.2d
			id: "1C4A7CC605B59DF7"
			min_width: 500
			rewards: [
				{
